{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120045","id":3814893824,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7jYqkA","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120045","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120045.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120045.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120045","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120045/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120045/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120045/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a38fc7828c698b5049a678e4bdd5c1eb7cb95ceb","number":120045,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"`SpinBox`: Make `KP_PERIOD` always write `.`","user":{"login":"Moddingear","id":20213502,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwMjEzNTAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20213502?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear","html_url":"https://github.com/Moddingear","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Moddingear/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Some languages use a comma instead of a period. This causes issues with the number parser, so the previous workaround was to replace the comma with a period in the string.\r\n\r\nThe main place where this is actually an issue is when using the numpad, as those languages replace the period with a comma in the numpad. So, this intercepts the KP_PERIOD and forces print a period.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/119946\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAlso replaced number literals in translation_server with their chars for improved readability.\r\n\r\nOther ways to fix this that were considered:\r\n- Add a language line in the translation server: overkill to translate the whole string just for a comma\r\n- move the spinbox line out of update on change: this causes other issues, possibly with expressions\r\n\r\nMaybe in the future doing number input completely using physical keycodes could allow to lessen the use of the language server in the spinbox to allow expressions in there ?","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu